<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Kegalle 6-mth net up 48 pct.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Kegalle 6-mth net up 48 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Sri Lanka's Kegalle Plantations Limited for the six months to September 30, 1996. (in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>		     6 months 1996	     6 months 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	    315.11	vs	   254.24</p>
<p>    Net profit	   40.15	vs	    27.15</p>
<p>NOTE - Kegalle Plantations is one of six newly privatised estate firms trading in Colombo. There was no tax provision on account of tax losses brought forward.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom tel 941-434319</p>
</text>
